# Verdict

The signed-tangent branch did not produce a new hidden computational mechanism; Vahanwala already built it.

It produced something more useful: an exact classification bridge.

For an \(n\)-state doubly stochastic Markov chain,

\[
\boxed{
(M^t)_{ij}-1/n
}
\]

is an LRS of order at most \(n-1\).

Conversely, every order-\(k\) LRS can be encoded in the stationary-coordinate deviation of a strictly-positive doubly-stochastic \((k+1)\)-state chain.

Therefore the longstanding arithmetic frontier of recurrence positivity is exactly a frontier of transient sign geometry around a globally stable stochastic equilibrium.
